OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold but bright start to the
OL,6,Fnew week, with sunshine turning
OL,7,Fincreasingly hazy through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Mostly dry but rain arrives
OL,9,Fin the southwest during the afternoon.
OL,10,FFeeling chillier today than yesterday
OL,11,Fwith below average temperatures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud and rain moves in from
OL,14,Fthe southwest overnight, turning
OL,15,Fheavy, persistent and falling as snow
OL,16,Fover northern hills. Turning windy,
OL,17,Fwith gales possible over hills and
OL,18,Ftowards the coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
