OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA damp start on Tuesday with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, sometimes heavy,
OL,7,Fturning drier through the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells developing. A milder
OL,9,Fday than yesterday, but rather breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,12,Fchangeable few days ahead, remaining
OL,13,Fchilly with blustery showers on
OL,14,FWednesday. Further outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Fon Thursday, before winds ease and
OL,16,Fbrighter skies return on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
